  "description": "Test build of Taliyah as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Taliyah so Weaver's Wall is real terrain - the upright wall behind her target and the long wall she rides are walls no champion, minion or monster can cross (she stands on top while riding), instead of the data pack's stand-in, a zone that slows enemies at its edge; and Rock Surfing gives her move speed near terrain (the map's walls and her own) out of fights, by level as in League, instead of the data pack's flat 10% out of fights. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
